	<string>FinderPlus searches your Documents folder when it is one of the locations you choose.</string>
	<key>NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FinderPlus searches your Downloads folder when it is one of the locations you choose.</string>
	<key>NSRemovableVolumesUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FinderPlus searches removable drives when you search all volumes.</string>
	<key>NSAppleEventsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FinderPlus asks Finder which folder its front window shows, so you can search the Active Finder Window.</string>
	<key>NSNetworkVolumesUsageDescription</key>
	<string>FinderPlus searches network volumes when you search all volumes.</string>
</dict>
